      "content": "that's a pretty intense way to frame it. but wouldn't a history professor want me to look at the religious or historical ties too? i mean, for many groups, those connections are the actual basis for their identity and their claim to the land. if i just dismiss them as \"convenient excuses,\" am i not being biased by ignoring a huge part of why people actually care about this territory?",
